WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:02.535
-Welcome back. We're hanging out
with Anthony Mackie.

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:04.704
Now, Anthony,
since you play an android

00:00:04.704 --> 00:00:06.806
in your new movie
"Outside the Wire,"

00:00:06.806 --> 00:00:08.841
