your robot skills to the test

00:00:08.841 --> 00:00:11.111
and play a game called
"Hey Robot."

00:00:11.111 --> 00:00:14.647
-♪ Hey, hey, hey, robot ♪

00:00:14.647 --> 00:00:16.348
♪ Hey, robot ♪

00:00:16.348 --> 00:00:19.452
-Alright, so, this is based on
the real board game "Hey Robot"

00:00:19.452 --> 00:00:20.687
that you can play at home.

00:00:20.687 --> 00:00:23.189
It's like the classic game
Password,

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:26.158
but your partner
is a smart speaker.

00:00:26.158 --> 00:00:28.094
Alright? So, first I'll pick
a card with a word on it.

00:00:28.094 --> 00:00:30.430
Then we'll take turns
asking a question

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:34.167
to get the speaker to say that
word somewhere in its answer.

00:00:34.167 --> 00:00:35.668
If it does, we get a point.

00:00:35.668 --> 00:00:36.569
Ready?

00:00:36.569 --> 00:00:37.703
-Okay.

00:00:37.703 --> 00:00:39.839
-Alright.
I will go first.

00:00:39.839 --> 00:00:44.511 line:0%
Alright, the word is --
the word is "kiwi."

00:00:44.511 --> 00:00:45.878 line:0%
-Hmm.

00:00:45.878 --> 00:00:47.847 line:0%
-The word is "kiwi."

00:00:47.847 --> 00:00:50.950 line:0%
Okay.

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:57.223 line:0%
